# React Query Hooks

## Naming Convention

| Hook Type | Pattern | Example |
|-----------|---------|---------|
| Query (list) | `use[Domain]s` | `useAccounts` |
| Query (single) | `use[Domain]` | `useAccount(id)` |
| Mutation (create) | `useCreate[Domain]` | `useCreateTransfer` |
| Mutation (update) | `useUpdate[Domain]` | `useUpdateAccount` |
| Mutation (delete) | `useDelete[Domain]` | `useDeleteContact` |

## File Structure

```
features/[domain]/hooks/
├── useAccounts.ts      # List query
├── useAccount.ts       # Single query + balance
├── useCreateAccount.ts # Mutations
└── index.ts            # Re-exports
```

## Query Hook Pattern

```typescript
import { useQuery } from '@tanstack/react-query';
import { accountKeys } from '@repo/core/domains/accounts';
import { accountsService } from '@/services';

export function useAccounts() {
  return useQuery({
    queryKey: accountKeys.lists(),
    queryFn: accountsService.getAll,
    staleTime: 5 * 60 * 1000,
  });
}

export function useAccount(id: string) {
  return useQuery({
    queryKey: accountKeys.detail(id),
    queryFn: () => accountsService.getById(id),
    enabled: !!id,
  });
}
```

## Mutation Hook Pattern

```typescript
import { useMutation, useQueryClient } from '@tanstack/react-query';
import { transferKeys, accountKeys } from '@repo/core/domains/transfers';
import { transfersService } from '@/services';

export function useCreateTransfer() {
  const queryClient = useQueryClient();

  return useMutation({
    mutationFn: transfersService.create,
    onSuccess: () => {
      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: transferKeys.all });
      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: accountKeys.all });
    },
  });
}
```

## Rules

- Import query keys from `@repo/core/domains/*`
- Import services from `@/services`
- Invalidate related queries on mutations
- Use `enabled` for conditional queries
- Set appropriate `staleTime`

